SUMMARY:Santa in the Village
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate the 10th Annual Santa in the Village! This beloved family tradition is filled with festive holiday fun\, activities for all ages\, and plenty of reasons to make a day of it. Come celebrate the season\, enjoy the festivities\, and experience the magic of the holidays in Bloor West Village! \n🗓️ Saturday\, November 21 | 10 AM – 4 PM📍 Green P Parking Lot (Carpark 91)\, 265 Armadale Ave \n📸 Photos with Santa for a Great Cause!\nReservations for your family photo will be available from 10:30am – 12:00pm and 12:00pm – 12:00pm (limited spots). Then first-come\, first-serve general walk-in (no reservation) available from 2:00 – 4:00pm. Reservations will open November 14. Each photo reservation will be $10\, with 100% of proceeds going to the Bloor West Food Bank. Stay tune for the registration link! \n🎁 Here’s what’s in store:\n🔹 Photos with Santa (reservation required)\n🔹 Festive carolers and live music\n🔹 Kids’ entertainment and costumed characters\n🔹 Festive Express holiday choo-choo train rides\n🔹 Holiday Marketplace with local artisans and shops\n🔹 Explore Bloor West Village’s local shops\, discover thoughtful gifts\, enjoy festive treats and find plenty of holiday shopping inspiration. \n✨ Gather your family and celebrate the magic of the season with us in the Village. \n✨ ✨ Interested in being a VENDOR in our marketplace? Please complete this form
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/santa-in-the-village/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Santa.png
